# Density Compare
# Thulium (Tm) — real density 9.32 g/cm³. equal masses: Thulium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Thulium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.5mm color: #8ccbe0 at (-20mm, 4.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 74.3 g — the water cube is the reference
